innova2-app (1.2.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian packaging: innova2-app (the app) and innova2-areg-dkms
    (the innova2_areg kernel module, built by DKMS for every installed
    kernel that has headers).
  * --transport kmod replaces --transport node (still accepted).
  * The burn read-back scratch file goes to /var/lib/innova2-app when it
    exists.
  * build.sh leaves the module alone when innova2-areg-dkms manages it.
  * README: reorganised; mlx5_fpga_tools was removed in MLNX_OFED 5.3.

